MEM-226-26
Congresswoman Debbie Wasserman Schultz seeks an organized and motivated self-
starter to serve as Scheduler in her fast-paced Washington, D.C. office. Candidates are
expected to keep the Congresswoman’s schedule updated, respond to and process
invitations for meetings and events in a timely manner, and manage the Congresswoman’s
travel plans and logistics.
The Scheduler will work closely with the Chief of Staff, District Director, Legislative Director
and Communications Director, and other duties as assigned. The incumbent will have the
opportunity to work with every part of the operation and will be needed to work some
nights and weekends as needed.
