• Maintains a good working relationship with the Member, staP and constituents;
• Prepares the daily schedule for the Member, and distributes copies to the
Washington, D.C. and district oPices;
• Prepares projected schedules for the Member and FL-25 Team;
• Briefs the Member on all scheduling activities for the Washington, D.C. and district
oPices and makes recommendations to improve ePiciency;
• Schedules all staP meetings and briefings involving the Member;
• Coordinates scheduling of press interviews and recordings with the Comms Team;
• Makes reservations for the Member's air travel, ground transportation, and lodging;
• Reviews the Member's mail and invitations;
